{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日，希音在港交所公告《關於美國聯邦貿易委員會調查的最新進展》。公告顯示，誠如公司日期為2026年8月24日的招股章程及2026年9月28日的2026中期報告所披露，美國聯邦貿易委員會（『FTC』）就本公司在美國的業務運營開展了調查（『該調查』）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587928.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.054239+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:41:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:15.320420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:15.320420+00:00","content_hash":"046be5798b273611c06bdf16a1d64753d571fe744480de0c5a446d745f61fadf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}